  READING: for the block, Var >> diagonal (R2-resonance dominates).  The damped pair
  resonance (1-th)^{2(k-2)}(R2/2)c_2 captures the bulk; the residual is the TRIPLE/QUAD
  resonance E_3 c_3 + E_4 c_4 + ... (the additive-energy multipliers E_j on the exact
  kernels c_j).  The (1-th)^{2(k-2)} damping is why the naive (R2/2)c_2 (opus-S151, 27x
  too big) collapses to the true c ~ 6e-5 (mac-mini/klein LEM-007).
